== Trivia ==
*'''Garlacius''' has no dialogue unless having purchased [[Ashera]]'s tip. After talking to them, they will no longer give dialogue.
*'''Garlacius''' does, however, display text above their head, as if communicating with the other [[NPC]]s in the {{zone|Shifted Tavern}}.
*The name '''Garlacius''' comes from the skin's creator, who titled it as such for a contest.

